User Flow:
1. [Start] -> App Launch
2. Main Screen:
   - Button: "Select Images/Folder"
   - List: Selected Files Preview
   - Button: "Process Images" (disabled until selection)
3. Processing Screen:
   - Progress Bar (with % overlay)
   - Cancel Button
4. [Success] -> Notification + "Open Folder" Button
5. [Error] -> Retry/Cancel Dialog

System Flow:
Selection -> Validation -> Border Detection -> Cropping -> Save -> Cleanup



